  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 60 × 10 + 12 ÷ 4 − 16 = 74\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the signs:\n\nOption 1) − and +\n\n60 × 10 + 12 ÷ 4 − 16 = 74 ⇒ 60 × 10 − 12 ÷ 4 + 16 = 74\n\n⇒ 60 × 10 − __**12 ÷ 4**__ + 16 = 74\n\n⇒ __**60 × 10**__ − 3 + 16 = 74\n\n⇒ __**600 + 16**__ − 3 = 74\n\n⇒ __**616 − 3**__ = 74\n\n⇒ 613 ≠ 74 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) ÷ and ×\n\n60 × 10 + 12 ÷ 4 − 16 = 74 ⇒ 60 ÷ 10 + 12 × 4 − 16 = 74\n\n⇒ __**60 ÷ 10**__ + 12 × 4 − 16 = 74\n\n⇒ 6 + __**12 × 4**__ − 16 = 74\n\n⇒ __**6 + 48**__ − 16 = 74\n\n⇒ __**54 − 16**__ = 74\n\n⇒ 38 ≠ 74 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) + and ×\n\n60 × 10 + 12 ÷ 4 − 16 = 74 ⇒ 60 + 10 × 12 ÷ 4 − 16 = 74\n\n⇒ 60 + 10 × __**12 ÷ 4**__ − 16 = 74\n\n⇒ 60 + __**10 × 3**__ − 16 = 74\n\n⇒ __**60 + 30**__ − 16 = 74\n\n⇒ __**90 − 16**__ = 74\n\n⇒ 74 = 74 (LHS = RHS)\n\nOption 4) - and ×\n\n60 × 10 + 12 ÷ 4 − 16 = 74 ⇒ 60 + 10 - 12 ÷ 4 × 16 = 74\n\n⇒ 60 + 10 - __**12 ÷ 4**__ × 16 = 74\n\n⇒ 60 + 10 - __**3 **____**×**____** 16**__ = 74\n\n⇒ __**60 + 10**__ - 48 = 74\n\n⇒ __**70 - 48**__ = 74\n\n⇒ 22 ≠ 74 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, **\"Option 3\"** is the correct answer.",
